canvas 560 300
label "Composition: a selection of slugs runs through five fixed steps (closure over requires, hiding of superseded items, mutual exclusion, warnings, port wiring); steps one to four give the verdict, and only a valid verdict yields the Harness of seven kinds of file (highlighted)"
caption "The highlighted Harness is produced only after the verdict; the order of the five steps is fixed because reversing it changes verdicts."
box sel 16 110 96 50 "selection|(slugs)"
box s1 126 110 72 50 "1 closure"
box s2 208 110 72 50 "2 hiding"
box s3 290 110 72 50 "3 mutex"
box s4 372 110 72 50 "4 warnings"
box s5 454 110 72 50 "5 wiring"
text 162 178 "requires" size=10
text 244 178 "supersedes" size=10
text 326 178 "excludes" size=10
text 408 178 "contradicts" size=10
text 490 178 "ports" size=10
arrow sel s1
arrow s1 s2
arrow s2 s3
arrow s3 s4
arrow s4 s5
box verdict 126 220 160 44 "verdict (valid?)"
box harn 340 220 186 44 "Harness: 7 kinds of file" acc
arrow s4 verdict
arrow verdict harn
arrow s5 harn
note "order is fixed; an invalid selection yields the verdict alone and no Harness"
